body: "# W5 touring-storage Fusion — COMPLETE\n\n**Date**: 2026-05-15\n**Wave**: W5 (touring-storage Fusion) of touring-premium-refactor-2026\n**Status**: COMPLETE — all subtasks done\n**Workspace state**: GREEN (cargo check --workspace 0 errors)\n\n## Result\n\nFive historically-separate storage crates fused into a single\n`touring-storage` crate; the originals reduced to one-file re-export shims.\n\n| Source crate | LOC src | Fate |\n|---|---|---|\n| touring-vfs | 1,590 | touring-storage/src/vfs/ |\n| touring-incremental-salsa | 387 | touring-storage/src/salsa/ |\n| touring-vector-store | 1,168 | touring-storage/src/vec/ |\n| touring-embeddings | 1,385 | touring-storage/src/embeddings/ |\n| touring-search-fusion | 1,496 | touring-storage/src/hybrid_search/ |\n| touring-storage (fused) | 6,046 | new crate, 36 files |\n\nEach source crate is now an 8-line shim: `pub use touring_storage::<module>::*`.\n\n## Critical Discovery — touring-index excluded (Cargo cycle)\n\nThe plan called for fusing 6 crates including `touring-index`. That is\nphysically uncompilable: `touring-index` depends on\n`touring-ast`/`touring-semantics`, and post-W4 `touring-code` depends on\n`touring-vfs` (`ast/file_heat.rs`). Fusing `touring-index` into\n`touring-storage` creates the Cargo crate cycle:\n\n    touring-code -> touring-vfs -> touring-storage -> touring-ast -> touring-code\n\nResolution: `touring-index` (incremental symbol indexing) is an\nintelligence-layer crate — it stays standalone and is deferred to W6\n(touring-intelligence). `touring-storage` fuses the 5 pure storage crates\nand depends only on `touring-foundation`, keeping it low in the graph.\n\n## Subtasks\n\n| # | Subtask | Outcome |\n|---|---|---|\n| W5.1 | Create touring-storage skeleton | taco-forge perfect-create-crate |\n| W5.2 | (touring-index) | DEFERRED to W6 — Cargo cycle |\n| W5.3 | Move touring-vfs | 9 files; 9 crate:: rewrites |\n| W5.4 | Move touring-incremental-salsa | 6 files; 10 crate:: rewrites |\n| W5.5 | Move touring-vector-store | 6 files; 26 crate:: rewrites |\n| W5.6 | Move touring-embeddings | 8 files; 9 crate:: rewrites |\n| W5.7 | Move touring-search-fusion | 6 files; 9 rewrites incl. intra-fusion |\n| W5.8 | lib.rs mount + storage-* features | no-default AND all-non-broken compile |\n| W5.9 | Convert 5 crates to shims | 5 one-file shims + feature forwarding |\n| W5.10 | Validate | check/clippy/test/cycles all green |\n\n## Validation Gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| cargo check --workspace | 0 errors |\n| cargo check -p touring-storage (default / --no-default-features) | 0 errors |\n| cargo test -p touring-storage | 141 PASS (124 lib + 17 integration) |\n| cargo clippy -p touring-storage + 5 shims | 0 issues |\n| consumer test compile (touring-server/generator/code) | 0 errors |\n| touring wiring cycles --min-depth 2 | 2 (unchanged vs W4) |\n\n## Fixes applied (REGRA #0 potencializar)\n\n- `voyage` embedding provider: added missing `#[async_trait]` on\n  `impl EmbeddingProvider for VoyageProvider` — fixed a pre-existing E0195\n  lifetime mismatch that broke the `voyage` feature in the origin crate.\n- 8 pre-existing clippy issues fixed in fused `vfs`/`salsa` code (those\n  crates lacked `[lints] workspace = true`, never lint-checked before):\n  needless borrow, identity map, clone-on-Copy, from_ref, match→if let,\n  module_inception, should_implement_trait, MSRV `is_multiple_of`, doc\n  indent, non-snake-case test fn, dead test helper.\n\n## Pre-existing breakage (NOT W5 regressions)\n\nVerified identical error counts in the ORIGIN crates before fusion:\n\n| Feature | Errors | Root cause |\n|---|---|---|\n| storage-vec-qdrant | 11 | qdrant-client API drift (CollectionInfo.params, PointId Display, Filter DeserializeOwned) |\n| storage-emb-candle | 5 | candle API — `candle_core::Model` / `candle_transformers::tokenizer` do not exist |\n\nBoth deferred to W11 (Test Debt Repayment). The fusion preserves origin\nbehavior faithfully — broken features remain identically broken.\n\n## Removed\n\n`touring-incremental-salsa` `queries_bench` — dead-on-arrival benchmark.\nIt referenced `FileId` (nonexistent symbol), called `FileText::new` with\nwrong arity, and used `Throughput::throughput` (nonexistent criterion API).\nNever compiled in the origin POC crate. Removed as dead code (REGRA #0).\n\n## Stale plan premise corrected\n\nThe plan claimed \"0% tests\" for search-fusion and salsa. Actual state:\nsearch-fusion had 40 test fns, salsa 11. No artificial +500 LOC test\npadding was needed; touring-storage ships 147 inline test fns + 4\nintegration files.\n\n## Files\n\n```\ncrates/touring-storage/                NEW — 6,046 LOC, 36 files, 5 modules\n  Cargo.toml                           merged deps + storage-* features\n  src/lib.rs                           mounts vfs/salsa/vec/embeddings/hybrid_search\n  src/{vfs,salsa,vec,embeddings,hybrid_search}/   fused source\n  tests/ (4 files, 349 LOC)            relocated integration tests\n\ncrates/touring-vfs/                    -> SHIM (8-line lib.rs)\ncrates/touring-incremental-salsa/      -> SHIM\ncrates/touring-vector-store/           -> SHIM\ncrates/touring-embeddings/             -> SHIM\ncrates/touring-search-fusion/          -> SHIM\ncrates/touring-index/                  UNCHANGED — standalone, deferred to W6\n\nscripts/touring_premium_refactor_2026/\n  w5_rewrite_crate_paths.py            NEW — generalized string-aware rewriter\n```\n\n## Next wave\n\nW6 (touring-intelligence Fusion) — depends on W3 + W4, now unblocked.\nW6 should absorb `touring-index` (the W5 deferral) alongside the\nintelligence-layer crates.\n"
